// spec: 11 Synchronization; 12 Runtime panics
// panics: WaitGroup.done; library-value
// A WaitGroup counter that would go negative panics (section 11).
var wg = WaitGroup.new()
WaitGroup.add(wg, 1)
WaitGroup.done(wg)
println("balanced")
WaitGroup.done(wg)

// expect
// out: balanced
// exit: 1
// err: WaitGroup.done: WaitGroup.done when the counter is already zero
